<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-689-10"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Last chance to register...</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We are just a few days away from the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-payments-summit?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>International Payments Summit</u></strong></span></a> on <strong>21st November in Birmingham</strong>. We have a few spaces left and hope you can join us!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />This is <em><strong>the</strong></em>&nbsp;event for HEI professionals, finance, international office and cross-departmental stakeholders to explore the role of agents, institutions, partners and organisations in better connecting and supporting international students.‌<br /></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />Here’s what to look forward to on the day:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Keynote talks</strong> on the outlook for student flows, assessing financial crime risks along the international student payment journey, ways to align agent due diligence &amp; finance, and more…</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Panel discussions</strong> on payment trends in India, China and Nigeria, and on opportunities for Finance and International Office teams to innovate</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The launch of <strong>new Flywire research</strong> which maps the international student payer journey and covers existing touchpoints, practices, challenges and opportunities</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The chance to <strong>network with 100+ peers from over 60 institutions</strong></span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">There is also an optional pre-event dinner on the 20th November - a great opportunity to connect in a smaller setting. Spaces for the dinner are reserved on a first come first served basis.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">For more details, you can view the full agenda here: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/international-payments-summit?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>International Payments Summit 2023</u></strong></span></a></span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">. </span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We hope you can join us!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The Flywire Team&nbsp;</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
